<title>CHINA: COMPANION MARBLE YEAR NET UP 12.31 PCT.</title>
<headline>COMPANION MARBLE YEAR NET UP 12.31 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   15.06  vs 14.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    62.96  vs 56.06</p>
<p>    Turnover		     617.33 vs 531.52</p>
<p>    Company name		 Companion Marble (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 10-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Marble and granite products distributor Companion Marble, a spinoff of construction materials concern Companion Building Material (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
